name getoptk
category Package
revision 23567
shortdesc Define macros with sophisticated options
relocated 1
longdesc The package provides a means of defining macros whose options
longdesc are taken from a dictionary, which includes options which
longdesc themselves have arguments. The package was designed for use
longdesc with Plain TeX; its syntax derives from that of the \hbox,
longdesc \hrule, etc., TeX primitives.
